 pve-manager (9.2.24) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * api: node shell: harden the console against crafted parameters by only
     passing the known Ceph version and repository options to the command of
     the Ceph installation wizard, rejecting any other parameter.
 
   * ui: consent banner: fix loading the web interface when the consent text
     contains a single quote, which broke the JavaScript of the page. This only
     affected texts set outside the web interface, for example through the API,
     as the web interface stores them base64-encoded.
